{"id":"73ccb673e6681e3d","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-compositional-completeness.md","title":"组合公理逐句恢复基础语言双条件","display":"thm-compositional-completeness — 组合公理逐句恢复基础语言双条件","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-compositional-completeness","aliases":["91-thm-compositional-completeness","91-thm-CT-completeness","91-thm-compositional-derivation"],"display":"thm-compositional-completeness — 组合公理逐句恢复基础语言双条件","depends_on":["[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]","[[91-df-T-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-compositional-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-compositional-completeness</span><span>91-thm-CT-completeness</span><span>91-thm-compositional-derivation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-compositional-completeness — 组合公理逐句恢复基础语言双条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" href=\"?note=b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" title=\"91-df-compositional-axioms\">91-df-compositional-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> (能处理语法编码并含原子真理公理的基础理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\)</span>\n(基础语言的否定、联结词与量词组合公理,\nsee <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" href=\"?note=b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" title=\"91-df-compositional-axioms\">91-df-compositional-axioms</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (基础语言句子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\n\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal B\\cup\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\n\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对每个固定句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 在元理论中作结构归纳。原子步由等式与算术\n原子真理公理给出，复合步分别应用相应组合公理；量词步使用数码代入\n函数及量词组合公理。</p>\n<p>结论是逐句去引号，不是说弱基础理论内部存在一个量化公式一次性断言\n“所有公式的 T-schema”，也不推出 TB 的闭实例能反向证明全部统一组合\n模式。完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}\\)</span> 是否保守还取决于其归纳模式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-compositional-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"b0b2a8b496dd82c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-compositional-axioms","status":"resolved","id